      "en": "“‘When you offer a sacrifice of peace offerings to the LORD, you shall offer it so that you may be accepted.",
      "ko": "너희는 화목제 희생을 여호와께 드릴 때에 열납되도록 드리고",
      "source_text_hash": "502ac0c48ab63c9f3848f54f455be33146ab7e216d8d49399c7eacaa0471aedd",
      "translation_text_hash": "fe81684ebabb32464fd465ddd91d6ec52fd87ae848e9ba97939b09e33f997e1f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희는 화목제 희생을 여호와께 드릴 때에 열납되도록 드리고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "fe81684ebabb32464fd465ddd91d6ec52fd87ae848e9ba97939b09e33f997e1f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LEV:19:6",
