      "en": "but everyone who eats it shall bear his iniquity, because he has profaned the holy thing of the LORD, and that soul shall be cut off from his people.",
      "ko": "그것을 먹는 자는 여호와의 성물 더럽힘을 인하여 죄를 당하리니 그가 그 백성 중에서 끊쳐지리라",
      "source_text_hash": "5525d70b171436a2d42cda0336417fcdd45b2dac475c1c6976606b8a327d99ed",
      "translation_text_hash": "2c315252f4d7d7df9a571eb613103f9c3c5955580170df561a5b474fc9620ce7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
