      "en": "He shall bring his trespass offering to the LORD, to the door of the Tent of Meeting, even a ram for a trespass offering.",
      "ko": "그 남자는 그 속건제물 곧 속건제 수양을 회막문 여호와께로 끌어올 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "5c830db3bedea21c06c12d96eda7556014d2cbf836f85ac3fabe0f6563b45963",
      "translation_text_hash": "318e7a13f04893430ec69115d34fe85c19862b708ab02d8d50ede728d1a7813e",
