      "en": "But in the fourth year all its fruit shall be holy, for giving praise to the LORD.",
      "ko": "제 사년에는 그 모든 과실이 거룩하니 여호와께 드려 찬송할 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "8d774a997f2dc737e16bfb3f8fbb92f32c7a0573e84cd242bf3e89de09f20ecd",
      "translation_text_hash": "fe719603a0687bac9c4765259f72d312249b379f3eb82e2bd40ccbf3eb71aad8",
